## Test Coverage Requirements

| Layer | Min Coverage |
|-------|-------------|
| Widgets | 80% |
| Providers | 90% |
| Models | 95% |
| Repositories | 85% |

---

## Running Tests

```bash
# All tests
flutter test

# Specific feature
flutter test test/features/experiments/

# With coverage
flutter test --coverage

# Watch mode
flutter test --watch

# Integration tests
flutter test integration_test/
```

---

## Mock Data Reference

Luôn dùng mock data từ `SNMS_APP_SPEC.md` khi viết test:

- `mockUsers` — 6 users (Researcher, FarmManager, 2 Technicians, 2 Students)
- `mockFarm` — Farm → Area → Zone → Bed → Sensor hierarchy
- `mockExperiments` — Active experiment với groups, stages, growth records
- `mockTasks` — Tasks với AI suggestions
- `mockNotifications` — Alerts, task updates, system notifications

